rooms_desc ({"You are on a cobblestone path leading from the mountains up    to the front door of Avery and Bober's second home.  As youlook toward the house in the north you hear the sounds of the ocean and can feel the breeze as it hits your face.  You havea sense of being very welcomed here.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","As you walk through the front doors of Avery and Bobers houseyou find yourself in a grand foyer.  To the left is a large staircase which seems to extend to the heavens.  The slate          floor glows from the light of the many skylights above and youcan hear the chime of the grandfather clock.  East you can seethe sunroom and to the north there are steps leading up to thegreat room.","A you walk up two steps you find yourself standing in a largeairy room with tall cathedral ceilings.  The north wall is madeup of large windows that allow the view of the beach and oceanto become one with the room.  The beautiful colors of the seacan be seen throughout the room as you look the furniture and        carpet.  Double french doors lead out to the deck towards theeast and to the west is the master bedroom.","Glancing around, it is obvious that you have entered the bedroom.  There is a hugh comfortable looking bed against one wall.  On thebed are many fluffy pillows of all shapes, sizes and colors.  Againstanother wall is a beautiful tall oak dresser with a large oval mirrowattatched to it.  Many different colognes, powders and such line the top of the dresser.  In the corner, there is a chaise lounge with atable next to it.  Most of the table is covered though with gorgeouspictures in solid oak frames.  With the windows against the far wall, aclear view of the ocean is seen with the waves laping over the rocks.The last thing you notice is Averys little \"pooh\" bear siting in the                                                               middle of the bed.  You think to yourself, aww...how cute:) ","Bright sunlight strikes you as you walk into this room of windows.You can feel the warmth of the sun as you sit in one of the many pieces of furniture placed around the room.  If you look to the south the mountains can be seen and to the north is the ocean.This room is full of exotic plants and trees which gives you thefeeling of the outdoors.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The Pathway","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","The Foyer","The Great Room","bedroom","The Sunroom","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,})
